      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Batching & Objective",
      "items": [
        "Flat 4096-token sequences (16 canvases × 256 tokens) with 2× accumulation for effective batch size 32 (131,072 tokens/step).",
        "Uniform noise schedule ᾱ(t) = cos²(π/2·t/T) corrupts x0 tokens with uniform vocabulary replacements.",
        "Chunked x0 cross-entropy computes fp32 logsumexp in 8192-token blocks, eliminating full (B,T,V) logit materialization."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Self-Conditioning & Fault Safety",
      "items": [
        "Pre-pass with probability 0.5 embeds predicted x̂0 posterior, feeding detached representations to the primary forward pass.",
        "Loss health guard verifies finite values before backward pass; 5 consecutive failures trigger atomic rollback to previous checkpoint."
